pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib45"><citation citation-type="journal">Yednock, T.A., C. Cannon, C. Vandevert, E.G. Goldbach, G. Shaw, D.K. Ellis, C. Liaw, L.C. Fritz, and L.I. Tanner. <year>1995</year>. &#x003b1;<sub>4</sub>&#x003b2;<sub>1</sub> integrin-dependent cell adhesion is regulated by a low affinity receptor pool that is conformationally responsive to ligand. <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>270</volume>:<fpage>28740</fpage>&#x02013;28750.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7499396</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib46"><citation citation-type="journal">Zhang, X., S.E. Craig, H. Kirby, M.J. Humphries, and V.T. Moy. <year>2004</year>. Molecular basis for the dynamic strength of the integrin &#x003b1;<sub>4</sub>&#x003b2;<sub>1</sub>/VCAM-1 interaction. <source>Biophys. J.</source> <volume>87</volume>:<fpage>3470</fpage>&#x02013;3478.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15347595</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>